abstract: >-
  Encodes Alan Greenspan's thinking methodology and rhetorical style into a
  reusable AI Agent skill, covering seven core frameworks including
  productivity-driven growth, global savings glut, irrational exuberance,
  Greenspan Put, NAIRU variation, data-dependent policy, and Fedspeak.
  This skill is a framework and stylistic tool and does not claim to
  represent Alan Greenspan personally.
